# Build context for `bench/compose/Dockerfile.sut`, whose context is the
# repo root because `app` is a workspace member and cargo needs the whole
# workspace present to resolve it.
#
# Everything here is either regenerated inside the image or has no bearing
# on what gets built. `framework/`, `suprnova-macros/`, `crates/`, `app/`
# and `Cargo.lock` must all stay in the context.

# Compiled artefacts — regenerated by the builder stage, and a host
# `target/` is both enormous and built for the wrong toolchain.
target/
**/node_modules/

# Vite output. The frontend stage builds this itself; shipping a host copy
# would let a stale local build silently become what the image serves.
app/public/
app/frontend/dist/

# Unpacked Laravel/Inertia sources kept for parity work. Gitignored,
# read-only, and hundreds of megabytes.
reference/

# Benchmark evidence from previous runs.
bench/results/

# Local state that must never end up in an image.
**/.env
**/.env.*
app/database.db
app/storage/
.git/
